 .../devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml         |  1 +
 .../bindings/regulator/willsemi,wl2868c.yaml  | 79 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 80 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/regulator/willsemi,wl2868c.yaml

